  "title": "MediaCrossOrigin",
  "description": "Value for a media element's `crossorigin` attribute. `'anonymous'` is the default for URL-backed media: without it a cross-origin video is playable but unusable as a render source, because uploading it to a texture taints the pipeline. `null` omits the attribute entirely, which accepts that trade for playback-only media.",
